    "title": "Welcome to the Admin Panel",
    "slug": "welcome-to-the-admin-panel",
    "excerpt": "A quick overview of how content is managed from this dashboard.",
    "content": "This admin panel lets you create and edit website content without touching code. Blog posts, about page copy, static pages, and site settings are all stored in JSON files on the server.\n\nUse the sidebar to navigate between content types and start publishing.",
